[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Stats/AttributeSet.cs" id="1_attrset"]

; A lesser dragon: well above the dire wolf (110) and the frost stalker, and nowhere near the Wild
; dragon's 1400. It is meant to be the hardest thing that can wander up to you in the Reach, not a
; boss — an encounter that spawns two of these should be a fight you can lose, and one you can also
; walk away from.
;
; The Mana pool is not decoration. 34D's silent failure is a creature with spells and no mana: it
; just stands there, with no warning anywhere. 90 against a 14/s channel is roughly three breaths
; before it has to fall back on its claws.
;
; It carries the frost it breathes, so the school it teaches you to fear is the one it is smug
; about — and answering that is what the drakescale mail this phase adds is for.
[resource]
